      "message": "Merge main into issue/2953-agie-planar-punch: port the oblique punch onto the zero-step setup\n\nMain rewrote the native writer for #2984 (zero-step PunchSetup20, the\n1.0 mm separation rule) and renamed the user-visible texts for #3537.\nKeep main's prepare() frame with its checked stock and start-hole setup.\nPort this branch's convex envelope check, exterior seam search and\ncorner-clearance checks into it, in place of the rectangle refusal.\nRefusal texts name the problem, not the machine. Port the tests to the\nnew prepare() signature and add an export test of the oblique punch\nthrough the zero-step setup.\n\nRefs #2953\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
