        "date": "2026-11-23T16:29:27Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge the ported #2955 into issue/2954-agie-stock-heights\n\nPort the measured QN2 stock heights onto the zero-step setup of #2984.\nThe measured offset table moves into camcraft_post::agie_setup.\nPunchSetup20 gets height_um and refuses an unmeasured thickness.\nThe height goes into ID_HEIGHT (piece and work) and ID_POSPOSZ. The\noperator review names the thickness and its four offsets. A 20 mm job\nstays byte-identical. The corner and face clearance use the measured\nrough offset of the selected thickness.\n\nRefs #2954\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
